flowchart TD
    Trigger["Completion, timeout,<br/>cancel, stop or kill"] --> Observe["observe()"]
    Observe -->|RUNNING| Graceful["signal(force=False)<br/>unless kill requested"]
    Graceful --> Force["signal(force=True)<br/>if still RUNNING"]
    Force --> Observe2["observe() again"]
    Observe -->|EXITED or CREATED| Confirm["Confirm the same state<br/>after verification_interval"]
    Observe2 --> Confirm
    Confirm --> Release["remove() then exists()"]
    Release -->|gone| Done["TerminationReport<br/>terminated, released"]
    Release -->|present or error| Retry{"Attempts left?"}
    Observe -->|UNKNOWN| Retry
    Retry -->|yes, after retry_delay| Observe
    Retry -->|no or total_timeout| Fail["TerminationVerificationError<br/>non_empty or unknown"]
